#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:137
msgid "Each metric yields one of four statuses: ok (full weight), warn (50 % of weight), fail (0), or info (0, no penalty). A score ≥ 80 is green, 50–79 amber, below 50 red."
msgstr "Setiap metrik menghasilkan salah satu dari empat status: ok (bobot penuh), warnai (50% dari bobot), gagal (0), atau info (0, tanpa penalti). Skor ≥ 80 berwarna hijau, 50–79 kuning keemasan, di bawah 50 merah."

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:136
msgid "Each post is scored 0–100 from six rule-based metrics: title, meta description, word count, heading structure, image alt coverage, and internal links. Ten points are always awarded for reading time (informational only). The remaining 90 points are distributed across the other metrics with weights that vary by content profile (see below)."
msgstr "Setiap posting dinilai 0–100 dari enam metrik berbasis aturan: judul, deskripsi meta, jumlah kata, struktur judul, cakupan alt gambar, dan tautan internal. Sepuluh poin selalu diberikan untuk waktu baca (hanya informatif). Sisa 90 poin didistribusikan ke metrik lain dengan bobot yang bervariasi berdasarkan profil konten (lihat di bawah)."

