#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:106
msgid "The API Response Cache stores the raw result of every AI request — translation, meta description, excerpt, and content generation — keyed by a hash of the inputs (content, language pair, provider, model). Disable during prompt tuning or when you need every request to reach the AI provider. Disabling does not delete cached entries — re-enabling restores them."
msgstr "Cache Respons API menyimpan hasil mentah dari setiap permintaan AI — terjemahan, deskripsi meta, kutipan, dan pembuatan konten — berdasarkan hash dari input (konten, pasangan bahasa, penyedia, model). Nonaktifkan selama penyesuaian prompt atau saat Anda membutuhkan setiap permintaan mencapai penyedia AI. Menonaktifkan tidak menghapus entri cache — mengaktifkannya kembali akan memulihkannya."

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:167
msgid "The daily quota (configured in Behavior → Limits) is tracked here. When the quota is reached, AI calls are suspended for the rest of the day. The table shows how much of the quota has been consumed."
