msgstr "Unggahan gagal — silakan coba lagi."

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:166
msgid "The usage table shows AI token consumption broken down by feature (translation, meta description, excerpt, FSE template, batch analysis), provider, and model. Use the date-range buttons to filter by today, last 7 days, last 30 days, or all time."
msgstr "Tabel penggunaan menunjukkan konsumsi token AI yang dipecah berdasarkan fitur (terjemahan, deskripsi meta, kutipan, template FSE, analisis batch), penyedia, dan model. Gunakan tombol rentang tanggal untuk menyaring berdasarkan hari ini, 7 hari terakhir, 30 hari terakhir, atau semua waktu."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:54
